<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Portucel hits 1997 high.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Portucel hits 1997 high.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese pulp group Portucel Industrial hit a high for 1997 of 1,072 escudos on the Lisbon bourse on buy recommendations from foreign brokers and good prospects for the sector this year, dealers said.</p>
<p>Portucel shares stood at 1,072 escudos, up 38, in volume of 164,740 shares at 1155 GMT.  </p>
<p>&quot;I think the share still has room to rise a little,&quot; said one operator who declined to give a target price for the stock.</p>
<p>Some dealers said optimism among investors over restructuring plans for the pulp sector in Portugal added to positive sentiment about the stock.</p>
<p>The previous high at 1,065 escudos took place in the first half of 1996.</p>
</text>
